d of contact to E from any point y,) outside E has", "x0": 0.1824175824175824, "y0": 0.6721056721056721, "x1": 0.8065934065934066, "y1": 0.6860916860916861}, {"text": "equation", "x0": 0.22527472527472528, "y0": 0.6876456876456877, "x1": 0.29120879120879123, "y1": 0.7008547008547008}, {"text": "Show that M lies on the chord of contact to E from any point on /.", "x0": 0.22637362637362637, "y0": 0.7591297591297591, "x1": 0.743956043956044, "y1": 0.7723387723387724}], [{"text": "QUESTION 8. (Continued) Marks", "x0": 0.11978021978021978, "y0": 0.08469308469308469, "x1": 0.878021978021978, "y1": 0.09634809634809635}, {"text": "(\u00a9)", "x0": 0.11978021978021978, "y0": 0.12742812742812742, "x1": 0.14065934065934066, "y1": 0.13908313908313907}, {"text": "R", "x0": 0.44065934065934065, "y0": 0.17560217560217561, "x1": 0.45274725274725275, "y1": 0.18492618492618493}, {"text": "A particle of mass m travels at constant speed v round a circular track of radius", "x0": 0.16703296703296702, "y0": 0.2680652680652681, "x1": 0.8153846153846154, "y1": 0.2874902874902875}, {"text": "R, centre C. The track is banked inwards at an angle 6, and the particle does not", "x0": 0.16593406593406593, "y0": 0.2851592851592852, "x1": 0.8153846153846154, "y1": 0.29836829836829837}, {"text": "move up or down the bank.", "x0": 0.16703296703296702, "y0": 0.3006993006993007, "x1": 0.3802197802197802, "y1": 0.31313131313131315}, {"text": "The reaction exerted by the track on the particle has a normal component N, and", "x0": 0.16593406593406593, "y0": 0.3278943278943279, "x1": 0.8153846153846154, "y1": 0.3411033411033411}, {"text": "a component F due to friction, directed up or down the bank. The force F lies in", "x0": 0.16703296703296702, "y0": 0.3395493395493395, "x1": 0.8153846153846154, "y1": 0.358974358974359}, {"text": "the range from \u2014N to where p is a positive constant and N is the normal", "x0": 0.16703296703296702, "y0": 0.35353535353535354, "x1": 0.8153846153846154, "y1": 0.372960372960373}, {"text": "component; the sign of F is positive when F is directed up the bank.", "x0": 0.16703296703296702, "y0": 0.3706293706293706, "x1": 0.7043956043956044, "y1": 0.3838383838383838}, {"text": "The acceleration due to gravity is g.", "x0": 0.16593406593406593, "y0": 0.3986013986013986, "x1": 0.44395604395604393, "y1": 0.41181041181041184}, {"text": "The acceleration related to the circular motion is of magnitude \u2014, and is", "x0": 0.16593406593406593, "y0": 0.4289044289044289, "x1": 0.8098901098901099, "y1": 0.44133644133644134}, {"text": "directed towards the centre of the track. R", "x0": 0.16703296703296702, "y0": 0.4397824397824398, "x1": 0.7329670329670329, "y1": 0.4522144522144522}, {"text": "(i) By resolving forces horizontally and vertically, show that", "x0": 0.18681318681318682, "y0": 0.4693084693084693, "x1": 0.6714285714285714, "y1": 0.4825174825174825}, {"text": "v? _ Nsin@-Feos@", "x0": 0.4208791208791209, "y0": 0.4972804972804973, "x1": 0.6, "y1": 0.5221445221445221}, {"text": "Rg Ncos@+", "x0": 0.42417582417582417, "y0": 0.5236985236985237, "x1": 0.5395604395604395, "y1": 0.5361305361305362}, {"text": "(ii) Show that the maximum speed v,,,, at which the particle can travel", "x0": 0.1824175824175824, "y0": 0.5524475524475524, "x1": 0.8043956043956044, "y1": 0.5672105672105672}, {"text": "without slipping up the track is given by", "x0": 0.22637362637362637, "y0": 0.5695415695415695, "x1": 0.5395604395604395, "y1": 0.5827505827505828}, {"text": "Vmax _ tan +", "x0": 0.44175824175824174, "y0": 0.5990675990675991, "x1": 0.5769230769230769, "y1": 0.6216006216006216}, {"text": "Rg", "x0": 0.44945054945054946, "y0": 0.6262626262626263, "x1": 0.4703296703296703, "y1": 0.6386946386946387}, {"text": "[You may suppose that < 1.]", "x0": 0.22637362637362637, "y0": 0.6565656565656566, "x1": 0.5054945054945055, "y1": 0.668997668997669}, {"text": "(iii) Show that if 42 tan@, then the particle will not slide down the track,", "x0": 0.1769230769230